  "fullDescription": "Step into a dreamy pastel world with this adorable unicorn clipart bundle! Featuring 10 sweet illustrations including unicorns, a rainbow, castle, cupcake, magic potion and more — all in soft, child-friendly colors — this set is perfect for kids’ crafts, party printables, planner stickers and digital designs.\n\nEach PNG file comes with a transparent background, so they’re ready to use in all your magical projects.\n\n✦ What’s included\n• 10 individual clipart elements\n• File format: PNG with transparent background\n• High resolution: 300 DPI\n\n✦ Perfect for\n• Birthday party printables\n• Scrapbooking and journal pages\n• Nursery wall art or invitations\n• Planner stickers and labels\n• DIY cards and tags\n\n✦ Features\n• Soft pastel palette (pink, yellow, blue, lilac)\n• Transparent background for easy layering\n• High-quality and clean lines\n• Perfect for both digital and printable use\n• Child-safe and kawaii-inspired\n\n🦄 Let your imagination gallop with this whimsical unicorn set — perfect for making any project a little more magical!",
